Watch [AttributeExplorer]
To display the values of the watchable attributes of any of the stations which you typed in on the tab
Attributes, click Watch.
Remarks
Before you can select settings, click the Inheritance 
  check box so that it looks like this 
 .
Plant Simulation displays the background of the cells in different colors to show if the attribute is
watchable or not.
Color Description
blue The attribute is not watchable.
gray The attribute is watchable.
red You entered an invalid path to an attribute.
