Tab Objects [AttributeExplorer]
View or edit the attributes of an object on the tab Objects.
Remarks
Before you type in data, click the Inheritance 
  check box so that it looks like this 
 .
• To view or to edit the attributes of an object, drag that object from the Frame window over the tab
Objects in the open dialog of the AttributeExplorer and drop it there. Plant Simulation inserts the
absolute path to and the name of the object into the selected cell of the list on the tab.
You can also select and then drag-and-drop multiple objects at the same time!
Plant Simulation adds the object in the order in which you selected them in the Frame.
• To just enter the name of the object, drag that object from the Frame window over the icon of the
AttributeExplorer and drop it there.
Tab Objects [AttributeExplorer]
Plant Simulation Help 11-4419
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Note
F2 opens the dialog of the object, whose name you typed into the text box.
To manipulate the contents of the list, use the commands on the Context Menu of Embedded Lists.
