Operator [AttributeExplorer]
Click in the cell once with the left mouse button and select a boolean Operator from the drop-down list.
Remarks
This Operator connects the boolean values of the active row with the next row. The boolean values result
from evaluating the logical expression that you defined in a row of the query table.
You can select one of these settings:
• and
• or
Operator [AttributeExplorer]
